---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services | OpsDevCode"
  description="Platform health checks, FinOps, IaC, CI/CD, Kubernetes, custom tooling, agentic development. How we work together."
>
  <Header active="Services" />
  <main id="main">
    <div class="wrap">
      <section class="section" id="services">
        <h2 class="section-title">What I do</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-2col">
            <div class="tile" id="platform-health">
              <h3>Platform Health Check</h3>
              <p>I dig into your AWS, GCP, EKS, and IaC setup and give you a straight-up report: what's working, what's not, and what to fix first.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>FinOps</h3>
              <p>Visibility into cloud spend, disciplined allocation, and engineering fixes — so your bill matches how you actually run.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>IaC</h3>
              <p>Terraform, Pulumi, Crossplane — structure, state, and delivery so infra changes are predictable and owned by your team.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>CI/CD</h3>
              <p>Whether your organization is new to CI/CD automation or your pipelines need a revamp — I help you get delivery running smoothly and safely.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>Kubernetes</h3>
              <p>From cluster setup and day-two operations to automated scaling — EKS and the surrounding platform, done intentionally.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>Custom tooling</h3>
              <p>If you need custom automation and tooling, I can help you design and build them — or write them for you — so your team stops repeating the same manual work.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>Architecture Review</h3>
              <p>Before you lock in big decisions — networking, cluster layout, guardrails — I'll sanity-check the plan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>Fractional Platform Advisor</h3>
              <p>A few hours a week of senior guidance for your CTO or platform lead. No hiring required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3><a href="/agentic" style="color: inherit">Agentic Development</a></h3>
              <p>Adopt AI-assisted and agentic workflows — Cursor, Copilot, custom tooling — so your team ships faster without the chaos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="how">
        <h2 class="section-title">How we'll work together</h2>
          <div class="steps-row">
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>1) Quick intro (15 min)</h3>
              <p>We talk through what's going on and what you're hoping for. If it's not a good fit, I'll tell you straight up.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>2) I take a look</h3>
              <p>Usually read-only access — billing, K8s, your IaC repos. I try not to get in your team's way.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>3) You get a plan</h3>
              <p>Prioritized: quick wins first, then medium fixes, then the bigger structural stuff.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile">
              <h3>4) We fix it</h3>
              <p>I implement or pair with your team. Most of my work is async and time-boxed — no endless retainer.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="note" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            If you're about to hire a "Senior DevOps / Platform / SRE" because things are a mess,
            this is often a faster way to get stable first — before you add headcount.
          </div>
      </section>

      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-32);">
        <a class="btn primary" href="https://calendly.com/eric-opsdevco/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a discovery call</a>
      </p>

      <Footer />
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
